WEBVTT

00:01:58.781 --> 00:02:01.284
And then, reverse-engineering this

00:02:01.325 --> 00:02:05.163
by getting plenty of natural daylight
in the morning hours.

00:02:05.204 --> 00:02:10.751
And finally try to get some form
of physical activity each day.

00:02:10.751 --> 00:02:14.839
These things are much more likely
to help your sleep,

00:02:14.839 --> 00:02:17.175
rather than looking to melatonin

00:02:17.216 --> 00:02:19.969
for some kind of sleep assistance.